{"id": 8828255666374, "title": "Momcozy Contact-Free Smart Baby Monitor (BM08)", "body_html": "<ul>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Type</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1\">The BM08 is a cutting-edge <b data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1\" data-index-in-node=\"27\">momcozy smart baby monitor</b>. Designed as a next-generation <b data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1\" data-index-in-node=\"85\">video baby monitor</b>, it goes far beyond a traditional <b data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1\" data-index-in-node=\"138\">baby monitor camera</b> to act as an AI-powered, contact-free digital assistant for your nursery <i data-path-to-node=\"11,0,1\" data-index-in-node=\"231\">(Note: NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE and not intended to diagnose medical conditions/SIDS)</i>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Core Selling Points</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1\">Widely praised as a top contender for the <b data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1\" data-index-in-node=\"42\">best baby monitor</b>, this <b data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1\" data-index-in-node=\"66\">smart baby monitor</b> is powered by advanced contact-free mmWave sensing to detect baby's motion and generate sleep activity logs without any wearables. It features true AI cry detection that distinguishes real crying from background noise and automatically plays soft white noise to soothe your little one. The 2K HD video offers an 8x digital zoom to see every tiny detail. Late at night, the 940nm invisible infrared LEDs deliver premium, glare-free <b data-path-to-node=\"11,1,1\" data-index-in-node=\"516\">night vision</b>, illuminating the room in complete darkness without disrupting your baby’s sleep. Data is highly secure with 128-bit AES encryption and dual-band 2.4/5GHz Wi-Fi + Bluetooth support.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material &amp; Touch</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,1\">Constructed from eco-friendly, non-toxic, food-grade plastics with a durable, impact-resistant finish. The back of the monitor features an ergonomically molded, anti-slip texture for a secure and comfortable grip.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Target Audience / Use Case</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,1\">Specially designed for data-driven, modern parents who want contact-free sleep tracking, smart notifications without false alerts, and a rock-solid Wi-Fi connection throughout a large house.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Size &amp; Compatibility</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,4,1\">The parent unit adopts a lightweight, pocket-friendly design. The camera features advanced sensor placement and a high-grade lens array that operates perfectly from sunrise to midnight.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Care Instructions</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,5,1\">Periodically clean dust from the camera lens using a soft brush or lens cloth to maintain optimal 2K clarity. Keep the unit away from direct moisture, humidifiers, and prolonged direct sunlight.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>", "vendor": "Momcozy", "product_type": "Baby Monitor", "created_at": "2026-03-25T07:12:05-04:00", "handle": "momcozy-contact-free-smart-baby-monitor", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:59-04:00", "published_at": "2026-05-21T04:46:07-04:00", "template_suffix": "bm08-2026", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "baby care, baby monitor, baby safety, baby watch, best baby monitor, BM08, Breastfeeding supplies, Momcozy baby monitor, Top100_Sales, 婴幼儿", "variants": [{"id": 45653313781958, "product_id": 8828255666374, "title": "Default Title", "price": "219.99", "sku": "BM008-WH71000N10101-A", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "249.9